# Local development uses a SQLite file at prisma/data/dev.db (the path
# below is relative to prisma/schema.prisma, not the project root). This
# same file is committed to the repo so the deployed site on Vercel has
# data to read. For hosting online with multiple people viewing/updating
# data at once, switch this to a hosted database instead (Postgres, or a
# hosted SQLite service like Turso) — a plain file won't reliably persist
# writes on serverless hosting.
DATABASE_URL="file:./data/dev.db"
